{"title":"Ogre","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 35 Ogre that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/ogre-bone-needle\">Ogre Bone Needle</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(352.0px,-412.5px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-3/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-768px;top:256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-3/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-768px;top:512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-2/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-2/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-1/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-1/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:512px\"><i style=\"left:-338.2px;top:407.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:-365.7px;top:418.0px\"></i></div><figcaption>Ogre Den</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Den\">Ogre Den</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"ogre\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2>